## Documenting medical necessity (A2005)

Clinical notes should show that Microlyte® was selected specifically for its antimicrobial properties to manage wound bioburden. At minimum, the note should:

1. Identify the presence — or risk — of microbial contamination at the wound site.
2. State that Microlyte® was applied to target and reduce wound bioburden through its sustained ionic silver antimicrobial activity.
3. Document the clinical rationale for choosing an antimicrobial matrix over a non-antimicrobial alternative.

